          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Gelatine Sculpt acts through the process of metabolizing the efficiency of the body, which helps the body metabolize the stored energy during the day. The ingredients contained within are chosen in such a way that they facilitate the process of appetite suppression, digestion, and metabolism.<br><br>The gelatin content in Gelatine Sculpt assists in making you feel fuller and therefore cuts down the tendency to snack unnecessarily. This enhances your awareness about calories consumed and creates a healthy eating habit.<br><br>Gelatine Sculpt works in tandem with your natural bodily processes to ensure sustainable effects in the long run. The use of plant-based extract in this formulation promotes thermogenic activity and metabolic efficiency that leads to the effective burning of fat and helps sustain optimal energy levels at the same time.<br><br>Moreover, the Gelatine Sculpt enables metabolic flexibility, which is essentially the ability of one’s metabolism to change from burning carbohydrates to fat. This ensures that there will always be a constant burn rate of calories. In addition, this supplement enables the body to have good digestion and proper nutrient absorption, thus ensuring that the body responds well to any kind of positive activity that one might engage in.<br>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
