          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\" selected>8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f81fbf\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"32\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-5.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n                            <b>Steps</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Mobirise is a free offline app for Windows and Mac to easily create small/medium websites,\n                            landing pages, online resumes and portfolios. 2500+ beautiful website blocks, templates and\n                            themes help you to start easily.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Green Tea Leaf Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Green tea leaf extract contains natural plant compounds called catechins, including EGCG. These compounds have been studied for their antioxidant properties and potential effects on energy metabolism. Green tea extract may also contain caffeine, depending on how it is prepared. However, the amount of caffeine and catechins matters, and the presence of green tea extract does not guarantee significant weight loss.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">2</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>African Mango Seed Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">African mango seed extract is commonly used in supplements marketed for weight management. It has attracted interest because researchers have investigated its possible relationship with body weight and metabolic health. However, available research is limited, and stronger clinical studies are needed to establish its effectiveness. Consumers should not assume that this ingredient automatically reduces body fat or produces lasting results.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Guarana Seed Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Guarana is a tropical plant whose seeds naturally contain caffeine. Caffeine can temporarily increase alertness and may have modest effects on energy expenditure. Its impact depends on the dose, individual sensitivity, and other caffeine sources in the diet. Too much caffeine can cause sleep disturbances, nervousness, or a rapid heartbeat, so the total amount in a supplement is important.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 4}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">4</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Grape Seed Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Grape seed extract is a source of polyphenols, including proanthocyanidins, which have antioxidant properties. These compounds have been studied for their potential effects on several aspects of health. In a supplement formula, grape seed extract may contribute plant-derived compounds, but there is insufficient evidence to conclude that it independently produces meaningful weight loss.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 4\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 5}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">5</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Maca Root Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><div>Maca root originates from the Andes and has a long history of traditional use. It is included in various dietary supplements intended to support general wellness and vitality. Research has examined several potential effects of maca, but evidence for direct fat-burning or body-contouring benefits is insufficient. Its inclusion should therefore be understood as a botanical component rather than a proven weight-management solution.</div></h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 5\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 6}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Capsicum Fruit Extract</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Capsicum fruit extract comes from peppers and may contain capsaicinoids, the compounds responsible for their characteristic heat. Researchers have investigated these compounds for their potential effects on thermogenesis and energy expenditure. Any effects are likely to depend on the formulation and dosage. Capsicum extract should not be considered a substitute for a balanced diet or regular exercise.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 6\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 7}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">7</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>L-Carnitine</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">L-carnitine is a naturally occurring compound that helps transport long-chain fatty acids into mitochondria, where they can be used for energy production. It is commonly found in sports-nutrition and wellness products. Although it has been studied for body-composition outcomes, results are mixed, and the presence of L-carnitine alone does not establish that Gelatine Sculpt causes fat loss.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 7\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 8}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">8</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Chromium Picolinate</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Chromium picolinate is a supplemental form of chromium, a trace mineral involved in normal nutrient metabolism. It is frequently included in products marketed for metabolic wellness. However, evidence that chromium supplementation meaningfully reduces body weight is limited. The quantity in Gelatine Sculpt should be checked on the current product label before drawing conclusions about its potential effects.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 8\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 9}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">9</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Neem</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Neem is a plant traditionally used in Ayurvedic preparations. Its leaves and other plant parts contain various naturally occurring compounds. The effects and safety of neem depend on the preparation and amount used, and strong evidence supporting its role in prostate health is limited.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 9\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 10}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">10</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Chromium</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Chromium is a trace mineral involved in normal nutrient metabolism. It has been studied for its potential relationship with insulin function and glucose regulation. However, evidence that chromium supplements consistently improve blood sugar control is limited, and supplementation should be discussed with a healthcare professional.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features20-3a",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vyOtKOZu0x",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardColor",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                ".image-wrapper": {
                  "margin-bottom": "2rem"
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "5rem 3rem",
                ".text-wrapper": {
                  "padding-left": "2rem"
                }
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover"
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features17",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features16\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#f81fbf\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <a href=\"https://mwebzuno.com/12163/7115/3/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/aquasculpt-money-back.webp\" alt=\"180-Days Money-Back Guarantee\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>60-DAYS 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Gelatine Sculpt - 60-Day Money-Back Guarantee<br><br></b>This product comes with a 100% satisfaction guarantee, meaning that you have a full 60 days to try out the formula and see for yourself how it benefits your health, with absolutely no risk at all.<br><br>We advise our clients to take Gelatine Sculpt on a daily basis for a minimum of 30 days while maintaining healthy lifestyles for the body to get adjusted to the effects of the product. We value your happiness and well-being.<br><br>Should anything go wrong or should you be dissatisfied in any way with your purchase, just email the customer service team at contact@customercs.com within 60 days after receiving your purchase. The team will help you get a refund in no time.<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
