          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Gelatine Sculpt </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to complement a weight-management routine. Its reported formula contains a combination of botanical extracts and other compounds commonly found in wellness supplements. While individual ingredients have been studied for different purposes, the benefits of the complete Gelatine Sculpt formula have not been established by strong clinical evidence.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports a Weight-Management Routine –</b>&nbsp;Gelatine Sculpt is promoted for people who want to manage their weight as part of a consistent lifestyle. However, meaningful weight management generally depends on balanced nutrition, physical activity, sleep, and sustainable daily habits. The supplement should not be viewed as a guaranteed weight-loss solution.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Provides Plant-Based Ingredients– </b>The reported formula includes botanical ingredients such as green tea extract, grape seed extract, and maca root extract. These plants contain naturally occurring compounds that have been studied for various biological properties. Their presence may appeal to consumers who prefer supplements containing plant-derived ingredients.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Includes Ingredients Studied for Energy Metabolism –</b>&nbsp;Some reported ingredients, including green tea extract and guarana, have been studied for their potential effects on energy expenditure and alertness. The actual effects depend on the ingredients' concentrations and the individual's response. These ingredients do not guarantee increased energy or greater calorie burning.</div></div><div><div><b><br></b></div></div><div><div><b>✅Contains Antioxidant-Related Plant Compounds– </b>Green tea and grape seed extracts contain compounds with antioxidant properties. Antioxidants are studied for their roles in protecting cells from oxidative stress. However, the presence of these extracts does not establish a specific antioxidant benefit from the finished Gelatine Sculpt product.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers a Convenient Supplement Format –</b>&nbsp;For consumers who prefer supplements over preparing multiple individual ingredients, a ready-made product may be convenient. Before choosing Gelatine Sculpt, check its serving instructions, ingredient quantities, storage recommendations, and whether the formulation suits your needs.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Includes Compounds Involved in Normal Bodily Functions –</b>&nbsp;The reported formula includes ingredients such as L-carnitine and amino acids. These compounds participate in normal physiological processes, including energy metabolism and protein-related functions. Their inclusion does not necessarily mean that supplementation provides additional benefits when dietary intake is already adequate.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Complement Healthy Lifestyle Habits –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>The reported formula includes ingredients such as L-carnitine and amino acids. These compounds participate in normal physiological processes, including energy metabolism and protein-related functions. Their inclusion does not necessarily mean that supplementation provides additional benefits when dietary intake is already adequate.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅May Complement Healthy Lifestyle Habits –</b>&nbsp;Some consumers use supplements alongside meal planning, regular movement, hydration, and consistent sleep. Gelatine Sculpt should be considered, at most, a potential addition to these habits—not a replacement for them. There is insufficient evidence to determine whether this particular formula provides an additional meaningful benefit.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Encourages a More Structured Wellness Routine –</b>&nbsp;Taking a supplement according to its label may help some people maintain a consistent daily routine. Nevertheless, a supplement alone cannot replace realistic goals, balanced meals, and regular physical activity.</span></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
